    "1": {
      "1.0_data_layer_refactor": {
        "status": "done",
        "commit": "5aad5fe, 61c2e21",
        "notes": "config/paths.py (MACHINE-keyed roots, canonical->on-disk model map, availability scan) + data_layer.py (single WSIDataset replacement) + runners/ (classifiers, cv_runner, results_io, thresholds, runlog). Parity vs old code path: data bit-identical on all 12 splits, metrics max|delta|=0.00e+00 across lin/knn/proto/rf/ann (tol 1e-6). Data-path speedup 41.5x warm-OS-cache, 162x with .npz cache (target was >=5x). Also found+fixed a reproducibility defect not in the work order: old train DataLoader used shuffle=True unseeded, and RF bootstrap depends on row order, so old RF numbers were not reproducible run-to-run."
      },
      "1.1_ann_hparam_selection_on_val": {
        "status": "done",
        "notes": "eval_ANN returns val_-prefixed validation metrics; all selection sites use them. Measured bias on TCGA/TTC/H-Optimus-1: folds 2 and 3 select a different architecture, fold 3 by +0.0330 test macro-F1; mean +0.0085. Found a SECOND form the work order's grep misses: metric_key = f'{model_type}_macro_f1' indirection in best_k notebook cells 7/11/15/19, TTC_exp cell 8, and slide_classification_surgen_best_k_labels_exp.py - all with real 2x2 ANN grids, all patched. Verified lin/knn/proto/rf grids are still single-point (unbiased). eval_knn's internal GridSearchCV is a legitimate nested search on training data, not test selection."
      },
      "1.2_ann_checkpoint_save_fix": {
        "status": "done",
        "notes": "torch.save removed from inside the grid loop (input_dim constant across the grid meant all 4 configs overwrote one path; disk always held the LAST entry, 256/128). save_ann_checkpoint() writes fold{f}_ann_{dim}_{h1}_{h2}.pth + fold{f}_ann_config.json after selection; load_ann_checkpoint() reads it with state-dict-shape inference as a legacy fallback. Verified state dict == config.json == selected config."
      },
      "1.3_ann_double_softmax_fix": {
        "status": "done",
        "notes": "nn.Softmax removed from the training graph (was fed to CrossEntropyLoss, which applies log-softmax internally). Softmax now only in predict_proba. One fold before/after: bacc 0.8148->0.8205, AUROC 0.8742->0.8879, macro-F1 0.7308->0.7412, acc 0.8252->0.8350. Improvement on every metric. ALL ANN checkpoints and results must be regenerated - sequenced with Phase 3."
      },
      "1.4_fail_loud_missing_slides": {
